#, machine, plain1
msgid "The newest of what they have done. Only the names of who they chat with are shown, never what a chat says: chats are end-to-end encrypted."
msgstr "Kõige uuem, mida nad teinud on. Näidatakse ainult nende nimesid, kellega nad vestlevad, mitte kunagi seda, mida vestlus ütleb: vestlused on otsast lõpuni krüptitud."

#, machine, plain2
msgid "The number of items you confirmed doesn't match what was chosen. Nothing was changed."
msgstr "Teie poolt kinnitatud esemete arv ei vasta valitud punktidele. Midagi ei muudetud."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "The numbers are always shown on your profile. This decides who can open each list and see the accounts on it. An account is only listed where its own setting allows it too."
msgstr "Need numbrid on alati teie profiilil. See otsustab, kes saab iga loendi avada ja seal kontosid näha. Konto on loetletud ainult seal, kus selle enda seade seda võimaldab."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "The open-source platform for independent internet communities"
msgstr "Avatud lähtekoodiga platvorm sõltumatutele internetikogukondadele"

#, machine, plain1
msgid "The original content is not retained anywhere, including in this history."
msgstr "Algset sisu ei säilitata kusagil, sealhulgas selles ajaloos."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "The other authors of a shared draft removed you as an author. What you wrote stays credited to you."
msgstr "Teised ühisprojekti autorid eemaldasid teid autorina. See, mis sa kirjutasid, jääb sinu arvele."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "The owner deletes a channel instead of leaving it."
msgstr "Omanik kustutab kanali selle asemel, et sellest lahkuda."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "The owner's role can't be changed."
msgstr "Omaniku rolli ei saa muuta."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "The page's current text isn't shown here; what you save replaces it."
msgstr "Siin ei näidata lehekülje aktiivset teksti; see, mida salvestad, asendab selle."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "The picture could not be stored. Try again later."
msgstr "Pildi salvestamine nurjus. Proovi hiljem uuesti."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "The picture goes to your own linked storage, not to this site. You can add a few words under it."
msgstr "Pilt läheb teie enda lingitud salvestusruumi, mitte sellele saidile. Selle alla võib lisada mõned sõnad."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "The picture you chose"
msgstr "Valitud pilt"

#, machine, plain1
msgid "The post appears on the profile of whoever publishes it first. Optionally forward it into guilds for community discussion: each guild gets its own independent copy with its own votes and comments. Guilds are forwarded to when the draft is first published."
msgstr "Postitus ilmub selle profiilile, kes selle esimesena avaldab. Valikuliselt edastage see kogukonna arutelu gildidesse: iga gildi saab oma sõltumatu koopia oma häälte ja kommentaaridega. Gildid edastatakse eelnõu esmakordsel avaldamisel."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "The post carries your name and is listed on your profile. Votes, comments and forwards are shared with its author, who edits and deletes it. You can step off at any time: the post stays, without your name."
msgstr "Postitus kannab teie nime ja on loetletud teie profiilis. Hääled, kommentaarid ja edasiliikumised jagatakse selle autoriga, kes neid redigeerib ja kustutab. Võite igal ajal lahkuda: postitus jääb ilma teie nimeta."

#, machine, plain2
msgid "The post is not listed on your profile. Votes, comments and forwards are shared with its author, who edits and deletes it. You can step off at any time: the post stays, without your credit."
msgstr "See postitus ei ole teie profiilis kirjas. Hääled, kommentaarid ja edasiliikumised jagatakse selle autoriga, kes neid redigeerib ja kustutab. Võite igal ajal lahkuda: postitus jääb ilma teie krediidita."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "The post refused the change."
msgstr "Postitus keeldus muudatusest."

#, machine, plain2
msgid "The post stays where it is, with your name taken off it, and leaves your profile. Its Rep leaves you too. Everyone who saw it with your name still knows it was you."
msgstr "Postitus jääb sinna, kus see on, teie nimi eemaldatakse ja jätab teie profiili. Selle maine jätab ka sinu. Kõik, kes nägid seda sinu nimega, teavad endiselt, et see olid sina."

#, machine, plain2
msgid "The post's author"
msgstr "Postituse autor"

#, machine, plain2
msgid "The post's author deleted it, so it is shown as Anonymous: no name and no link. The comments under it stay as they were; one its author deleted is shown as Anonymous too."
msgstr "Postituse autor kustutas selle, nii et see on näidatud anonüümsena: ei nime ega linki. Selle all olevad kommentaarid jäävad nii, nagu nad olid; üks selle autori kustutatud on ka anonüümne."

#, machine, plain1, python-format
msgid "The promo code `%(code)s` is not currently valid. Please begin a new transaction."
msgstr "Promo kood `%(code)s` ei ole praegu kehtiv. Palun alustage uut tehingut."

#, machine, plain1, python-format
msgid "The proposal for @%(name)s has been withdrawn."
msgstr "Ettepanek @%(name)s kohta on tagasi võetud."

#, machine, plain1, python-format
msgid "The role %(role)s was deleted."
msgstr "Roll %(role)s kustutati."

#, machine, plain1, python-format
msgid "The role %(role)s was made."
msgstr "Roll %(role)s sai tehtud."

#, machine, plain1, python-format
msgid "The role %(role)s was saved."
msgstr "Roll %(role)s salvestati."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "The royal bank has told us that you owe them some coin. You'll need to pay off your debts before you can continue."
msgstr "Kuninglik pank ütles meile, et sa võlgned neile mündi. Sa pead maksma ära oma võlad, enne kui saad jätkata."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "The rules"
msgstr "Reeglid"

#, machine, plain1
msgid "The rules below"
msgstr "Allpool esitatud eeskirjad"

#, machine, plain1, python-format
msgid "The rules can be at most %(count)s character."
msgid_plural "The rules can be at most %(count)s characters."
msgstr[0] "Reeglid võivad olla maksimaalselt %(count)s iseloomuga."
msgstr[1] "Reeglid võivad olla maksimaalselt %(count)s tähemärgid."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "The rules can't contain control or invisible characters."
msgstr "Reeglid ei saa sisaldada kontrolli ega nähtamatuid märke."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "The screenshot you are sending"
msgstr "Saadatav ekraanipilt"

#. %(status)s is an HTTP status code
#, machine, plain1, python-format
msgid "The server answered %(status)s."
msgstr "Server vastas %(status)s."

#, machine, plain1, python-format
msgid "The server answers with the posts to show and their order; %(site)s still hides anything a viewer may not see, and tells the server nothing about who is looking. Everyone is told that an outside server ranks this curation."
msgstr "Server vastab kuvatavate postitustega ja nende järjekorras; %(site)s peidab ikka midagi, mida vaataja ei pruugi näha, ja ei ütle serverile midagi selle kohta, kes otsib. Kõigile öeldakse, et välisserver reastab selle kureeritud sööda."

#, machine, plain1, python-format
msgid "The server named %(num)s post; you can see %(seen)s of them."
msgid_plural "The server named %(num)s posts; you can see %(seen)s of them."
msgstr[0] "Server nimega %(num)s postitus; näete neist %(seen)s."
msgstr[1] "Server nimetas %(num)s postitust; näete neist %(seen)s."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "The server thinks you're asking something silly. It might take you more seriously if you take off the jester outfit."
msgstr "Server arvab, et sa küsid midagi rumalat. See võib võtta sind tõsisemalt, kui sa võtad jester riided ära."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "The site refused the bot's session."
msgstr "Sait keeldus boti seansist."

#, machine, plain2
msgid "The site's admins have it already."
msgstr "Saidi administraatoritel on see juba olemas."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "The site's admins marked this guild sensitive, so only an admin can change this."
msgstr "Saidi administraatorid märkisid selle gildi tundlikuks, nii et ainult administraator saab seda muuta."

#, machine, plain2
msgid "The site's admins will read it. They are never told who reported."
msgstr "Saidi administraatorid loevad seda. Neile ei öelda kunagi, kes teatas."

#, machine, plain1, python-format
msgid "The stage is full (%(num)s person)."
msgid_plural "The stage is full (%(num)s people)."
msgstr[0] "Lava on täis (%(num)s inimene)."
msgstr[1] "Lava on täis (%(num)s inimest)."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "The storage service is not answering right now. Try again in a moment."
msgstr "Ladustamisteenus praegu ei vasta. Proovi hetke pärast uuesti."

#, machine, plain1, python-format
msgid "The summary can be at most %(num)s character."
msgid_plural "The summary can be at most %(num)s characters."
msgstr[0] "Kokkuvõte võib olla maksimaalselt %(num)s tähemärk."
msgstr[1] "Kokkuvõte võib olla maksimaalselt %(num)s tähemärki."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "The summary can be changed while the Space is live."
msgstr "Kokkuvõtet saab muuta, kui ruum on elus."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "The text isn't shown: this was removed by the site's administrators."
msgstr "Teksti ei näidata: selle eemaldasid saidi administraatorid."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "The text of this version was hidden by a site administrator."
msgstr "Selle versiooni tekst oli peidetud saidi administraatori poolt."

#, machine, plain1, python-format
msgid "The time before links must be a whole number of days, 0 to %(max)s."
msgstr "Aeg enne linke peab olema täisarv päevi, 0 kuni %(max)s."

#, machine, plain1, python-format
msgid "The time in the guild must be a whole number of days, 0 to %(max)s."
msgstr "Gildis peab aeg olema täisarv päevi, 0 kuni %(max)s."

#, machine, plain1, python-format
msgid "The title can be at most %(num)s character."
msgid_plural "The title can be at most %(num)s characters."
msgstr[0] "Pealkiri võib olla maksimaalselt %(num)s tähemärk."
msgstr[1] "Pealkiri võib olla maksimaalselt %(num)s tähemärki."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "The two revisions have the same text."
msgstr "Mõlemal versioonil on sama tekst."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "The upload did not arrive in your Google Drive. Try again."
msgstr "Üleslaadimine ei jõudnud sinuni Google Drive. Proovi uuesti."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "The upload did not arrive in your OneDrive. Try again."
msgstr "Üleslaadimine ei jõudnud sinuni OneDrive. Proovi uuesti."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "The upload did not arrive. Try again."
msgstr "Üleslaadimist ei saabunud. Proovi uuesti."

#, machine, plain1, python-format
msgid "The username @%(name)s has been pre-emptively reserved for: %(who)s"
msgstr "Kasutajanimi @%(name)s on ennetavalt reserveeritud: %(who)s"

#, machine, plain1
msgid "The usual order - everything from the guilds and accounts you add"
msgstr "Tavaline järjekord - kõik gildidest ja kontodest, mida lisate"

#, machine, plain1
msgid "The video did not finish uploading to Dailymotion. Add it again."
msgstr "Video ei lõpetanud üleslaadimist Dailymotion. Lisa see uuesti."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "The video did not finish uploading. Add it again."
msgstr "Video ei lõpetanud üleslaadimist. Lisa see uuesti."

#, machine, plain1, python-format
msgid "The website can be at most %(num)s character."
msgid_plural "The website can be at most %(num)s characters."
msgstr[0] "Veebileht võib olla maksimaalselt %(num)s tähemärgiga."
msgstr[1] "Veebileht võib olla maksimaalselt %(num)s tähemärki."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "The website can't contain a user name or password."
msgstr "Veebileht ei saa sisaldada kasutajanime ega parooli."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "The website can't contain spaces."
msgstr "Veebileht ei tohi sisaldada tühikuid."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "The website must start with https:// or http://."
msgstr "Veebileht peab algama https:// või http://."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "The website needs a full address, such as example.com."
msgstr "Veebisait vajab täielikku aadressi, näiteks example.com."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "The whole site <span class=\"text-muted\">(needs an age limit of a month or less)</span>"
msgstr "Kogu sait <span class=\"text-muted\">(vajab vanusepiirangut üks kuu või vähem)</span>"

#, machine, plain1
msgid "The wiki is off: only guildmasters see it."
msgstr "Viki on välja lülitatud: seda näevad ainult gildi moderaatorid."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "The wiki's first page can be emptied but not deleted."
msgstr "Viki esimest lehekülge saab tühjendada, kuid mitte kustutada."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "The word filter has no words at the moment."
msgstr "Sõnafiltril ei ole hetkel sõnu."

#, machine, plain1, python-format
msgid "The words for other languages are adapted from %(source)s (%(licence)s): words that are also ordinary, innocent words were left out."
msgstr "Teiste keelte sõnad on kohandatud alates %(source)s (%(licence)s): sõnad, mis on ka tavalised, jäeti välja süütud sõnad."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "The working copy as it is now. Only its authors can see this until it's published."
msgstr "Töökoopia, nagu see praegu on. Ainult autorid näevad seda, kuni see on avaldatud."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "Theater"
msgstr "Teater"

#, machine, plain1
msgid "Their commenting history will show here."
msgstr "Nende kommenteerimise ajalugu näitab siin."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "Their forwarding activity will show here."
msgstr "Nende edasiandmistegevust näidatakse siin."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "Their posting history will show here."
msgstr "Nende postituste ajalugu näitab siin."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "Their posts and comments are left out of your feeds and threads and they cannot notify you. They are not told, and they can still follow you, comment on your posts and message you. Their anonymous posts and comments are not hidden, as hiding only those would tell you who wrote them. Mute someone from the menu on any of their posts or comments, or from their profile."
msgstr "Nende postitused ja kommentaarid jäetakse teie voogudest ja lõimedest välja ning nad ei saa teid teavitada. Neile ei öelda ja nad saavad ikkagi teid jälgida, kommenteerida teie postitusi ja teile sõnumit. Nende anonüümsed postitused ja kommentaarid ei ole peidetud, sest peitmine ainult need ütleksid teile, kes need kirjutasid. Vaigistage keegi oma postituste või kommentaaride menüüst või nende profiilist."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "There are no approved users"
msgstr "Kinnitatud kasutajaid ei ole"

#, machine, plain1
msgid "There are no exiled users"
msgstr "Eksiilis kasutajaid ei ole"

#, machine, plain1
msgid "There are no guildmaster invitations."
msgstr "Gild moderaatori kutseid ei ole."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "There are no guildmasters."
msgstr "Gild moderaatorid puuduvad."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "There are no posts here."
msgstr "Siin ei ole postitusi."

#, machine, plain1, python-format
msgid "There is no account named @%(name)s."
msgstr "Puudub konto nimega @%(name)s."

#, machine, plain2
msgid "There is nothing here to appeal."
msgstr "Siin pole midagi edasi kaevata."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "There is nothing to save yet."
msgstr "Pole veel midagi päästa."

#, machine, plain2
msgid "There is nothing waiting for this ban."
msgstr "Mitte miski ei oota seda keeldu."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "There was a problem. Please try again."
msgstr "Oli probleem. Palun proovi uuesti."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "There were no names in that file."
msgstr "Selles failis polnud nimesid."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "There were no survivors."
msgstr "Ellujäänuid ei olnud."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "There's a shortage of perfect request entities in this world. Would be a pity to damage yours."
msgstr "Maailmas on puudus täiuslikest taotluste üksustest. Kahju oleks sinu oma kahjustada."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "There's already an open proposal like this one."
msgstr "Selline avatud ettepanek on juba olemas."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "There's no account with that name."
msgstr "Selle nimega kontot pole."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "There's no invitation to speak."
msgstr "Ei ole kutset rääkida."

#, machine, plain2
msgid "There's no recovery code to keep yet."
msgstr "Taastamiskoodi pole veel vaja hoida."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "There's nothing here right now."
msgstr "Siin pole praegu midagi."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "There's nothing left here but a giant smouldering crater."
msgstr "Siin pole enam midagi peale hiiglasliku hõõguva kraatri."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "These are the users you are subscribed to."
msgstr "Need on kasutajad, keda olete tellinud."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "These counts start from the day guild insights were switched on: before that the site did not record when people left a guild or how often its page was opened."
msgstr "Need arvud algavad päevast, mil gildi ülevaated olid sisse lülitatud: enne seda ei registreerinud sait, millal inimesed lahkusid gildist või kui tihti selle leht avati."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "These filters are saved as your default"
msgstr "Need filtrid salvestatakse vaikimisi"

#, machine, plain1
msgid "These topics"
msgstr "Need teemad"

#, machine, plain1, python-format
msgid "These users have been invited to moderate +%(guild)s."
msgstr "Neid kasutajaid on kutsutud mõõdukale +%(guild)s."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "They already have this role."
msgstr "Neil on juba see roll."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "They are 18 or over, so they can make their own account."
msgstr "Nad on 18-aastased või vanemad, nii et nad saavad oma konto teha."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "They are already in this circle."
msgstr "Nad on juba selles ringis."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "They are not told. Anyone you block leaves your circles."
msgstr "Neile ei räägita. Kõik, keda blokeerid, lahkuvad ringist."

#, machine, plain2
msgid "They are signed out everywhere, chat apps included. If they use chat, they may need their recovery code, or a browser where they've used chat, to read their old messages."
msgstr "Nad on igal pool lahti ühendatud, vestlusrakendused kaasa arvatud. Kui nad kasutavad vestlust, võivad nad oma vanade sõnumite lugemiseks vajada oma taastamiskoodi või brauserit, kus nad on kasutanud vestlust."

#, machine, plain1, python-format
msgid "They aren't in %(circle)s."
msgstr "Neid pole siin. %(circle)s."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "They aren't in this group."
msgstr "Nad pole selles grupis."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "They aren't muted here."
msgstr "Nad ei ole siin tummad."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "They can buy and spend coins, tip, buy Premium and join or run paid circles."
msgstr "Nad saavad osta ja kulutada münte, jootraha, osta Premium ja liituda või käivitada tasulisi ringe."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "They can host and join Spaces and run live threads. Voice calls in a Space also need Chat to be on."
msgstr "Nad saavad võõrustada ja liituda Spacesiga ning käivitada live-niite. Häälkõned ruumis vajavad ka vestlust."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "They can message people, join group chats and make calls. The site never shows you what a chat says: chats are end-to-end encrypted. Whoever knows their password can still sign in and read them."
msgstr "Nad saavad inimesi saata, liituda grupivestlustega ja helistada. Sait ei näita kunagi, mida vestlus ütleb: vestlused on otsast lõpuni krüptitud. Kes teab oma salasõna, saab seda ikka sisse logida ja lugeda."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "They can see what you do on the site: your posts, comments, votes, bookmarks, follows, guilds, who you chat with, that your account was reported, and your recent sign-ins. The site never shows them what your chats say, because chats are end-to-end encrypted. But anyone who knows your password, a parent who chose it included, can sign in as you: change it in Security so that only you know it. They choose which of these are on for your account:"
msgstr "Nad näevad, mida te saidil teete: teie postitused, kommentaarid, hääled, järjehoidjad, järgnevad gildid, kellega vestlete, et teie kontost teatati ja teie hiljutised sisselogimised. Sait ei näita neile kunagi, mida teie vestlused ütlevad, sest vestlused on otsast lõpuni krüpteeritud. Kuid igaüks, kes teab teie parooli, vanem, kes valis selle, võib teie sisse logida: muuta seda turvalisuses nii, et ainult sina tead seda. Nad valivad, millised neist on teie kontol:"

#, machine, plain2
msgid "They can start a guild. They still can't post or comment: a child account only reads."
msgstr "Nad võivad gildi käivitada. Nad ei saa ikka veel postitada ega kommenteerida: lapse konto ainult loeb."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "They can't comment on your posts or comments, chat with you or notify you by mentioning you. They are not told, but they may work it out if they try to comment on something of yours."
msgstr "Nad ei saa kommenteerida oma postitusi või kommentaare, vestelda teiega või teavitada teid mainides. Neile ei räägita, kuid nad võivad selle välja töötada, kui nad üritavad teie midagi kommenteerida."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "They don't have this role."
msgstr "Neil pole seda rolli."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "They go straight to your coin balance."
msgstr "Nad lähevad otse oma mündi tasakaalu."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "They haven't asked for that."
msgstr "Nad pole seda palunud."

#, machine, plain2
msgid "They leave the site. What they said stays in the Log as Anonymous, except for anything made in the last five minutes that nobody has commented on, which is erased. This can't be undone."
msgstr "Nad lahkuvad saidilt. See, mida nad ütlesid, jääb logisse anonüümseks, välja arvatud kõik, mis on viimase viie minuti jooksul tehtud, mida keegi pole kommenteerinud, mis kustutatakse. Seda ei saa tagasi võtta."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "They need to be in the guild, and not exiled from it."
msgstr "Nad peavad olema gildis, mitte pagendatud."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "They need to join the channel first."
msgstr "Nad peavad kõigepealt kanaliga liituma."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "They say they are 18 or over and asked you to release their account. If you do, it becomes their own and you can no longer see it."
msgstr "Nad ütlesid, et nad on 18-aastased või vanemad ja palusid teil oma konto vabastada. Kui sa seda teed, muutub see sinu omaks ja sa ei näe seda enam."

#, machine, plain2
msgid "They stay where they are, with your name taken off them. This can't be undone. Posts that need your name (for a Circle, or with tips) are listed afterwards as not changed."
msgstr "Nad jäävad sinna, kus nad on, ja sinu nimi võetakse neilt ära. Seda ei saa tagasi võtta. Postid, mis vajavad teie nime (ringi jaoks või näpunäidetega), loetletakse hiljem muutmata kujul."

#, machine, plain2, python-format
msgid "They wrote: %(note)s"
msgstr "Nad kirjutasid: %(note)s"

#, machine, plain1
msgid "They're already a helper."
msgstr "Nad on juba abilised."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "They're already on stage."
msgstr "Nad on juba laval."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "They've already been invited to speak."
msgstr "Nad on juba kutsutud rääkima."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "This Circle guild is by invitation only."
msgstr "See ringi gild on ainult kutsetega."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "This Google account has no YouTube channel yet. Create one at youtube.com, then try again."
msgstr "See Google konto ei sisalda YouTube Kanal veel. Looge üks Youtube.com-is, seejärel proovige uuesti."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "This Space"
msgstr "Kosmosest"

#, machine, plain1
msgid "This Space can't take a replay now."
msgstr "See ruum ei saa enam kordust teha."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "This Space has already started."
msgstr "See ruum on juba alanud."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "This Space has ended."
msgstr "See ruum on lõppenud."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "This Space has ended. Its board is still here to read."
msgstr "See ruum on lõppenud. Selle juhatus on veel siin, et lugeda."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "This Space has ended. Its chat is still here to read."
msgstr "See ruum on lõppenud. Selle jututuba on veel lugemiseks."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "This Space hasn't started yet."
msgstr "See kosmos pole veel alanud."

#, machine, plain1, python-format
msgid "This Space is full (%(num)s listener)."
