msgstr "Teie kontol on lapse lukustus, mida hoiab teie vanem või eestkostja, alates %(date)s."

#, machine, plain1, python-format
msgid "Your account has the child lock on, since %(date)s."
msgstr "Teie kontol on lapse lukustus, alates %(date)s."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "Your account is age-restricted, so its word filter stays on Child until you confirm your age in Settings."
msgstr "Teie konto on vanusepiiranguga, nii et selle sõna filter jääb lapsele, kuni kinnitate oma vanuse seadetes."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "Your account is age-restricted, so sensitive content stays hidden until you confirm your age in Settings."
msgstr "Teie konto on vanusepiiranguga, nii et tundlik sisu jääb peidetud, kuni kinnitate oma vanuse seadetes."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "Your account is being checked"
msgstr "Teie kontot kontrollitakse"

#, machine, plain1
msgid "Your account is being checked."
msgstr "Teie kontot kontrollitakse."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "Your account is marked sensitive."
msgstr "Teie konto on märgistatud tundlikuks."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "Your account is no longer marked sensitive."
msgstr "Teie konto ei ole enam tundlik."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "Your account is suspended."
msgstr "Sinu konto on peatatud."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "Your account is too new to write in this guild's channels yet."
msgstr "Teie konto on liiga uus, et seda gildi kanalitesse kirjutada."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "Your account is waiting for a quick check before it can do this. To skip the wait, verify an email address in Settings > Security."
msgstr "Teie konto ootab kiiret kontrolli, enne kui saate seda teha. Ootuse vahele jätmiseks kontrollige e-posti aadressi seadistustes > Turvamehed."

#, machine, plain1
msgid ""
"Your account is waiting for a quick check before you can post, comment, vote or follow. You can look around and set up your profile in the meantime.\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"To skip the wait, add and verify an email address in [Settings > Security](/settings/security)."
msgstr ""
"Teie konto ootab kiiret kontrolli, enne kui saate postitada, kommenteerida, hääletada või järgida. Võite vaadata ringi ja luua oma profiili vahepeal.\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"Ootamise vahelejätmiseks lisage ja kinnitage e-posti aadress [Seaded > Turvalisus](/settings/security)."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "Your account is your own now. It no longer has the child lock and your parent or guardian can no longer see it. They chose your password: change it in [Settings > Security](/settings/security), or they can still sign in as you."
msgstr "Sinu konto on nüüd sinu oma. See ei ole enam lapse lukk ja teie vanem või hooldaja ei näe seda enam. Nad valisid teie parooli: muutke seda [Seaded > Turvalisus](/settings/security) või nad saavad endiselt sisse logida."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "Your account needs to be at least 30 days old to post automatically."
msgstr "Automaatseks postitamiseks peab konto olema vähemalt 30 päeva vana."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "Your account needs to be at least 30 days old to run a bot."
msgstr "Teie konto peab olema vähemalt 30 päeva vana, et käivitada bot."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "Your account no longer posts automatically. Its posts stay."
msgstr "Teie konto ei postita enam automaatselt. Selle ametikohad jäävad."

#, machine, plain2
msgid "Your account only reads for now, so it can't comment. You can still vote, follow and bookmark."
msgstr "Teie konto loeb ainult praegu, nii et see ei saa kommenteerida. Võite hääletada, jälgida ja järjehoidja."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "Your account posts from these feeds from now on."
msgstr "Sinu konto postitused nendest uudistevoogudest nüüdsest."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "Your account was closed"
msgstr "Teie konto suleti"

#, machine, plain1, python-format
msgid "Your account's automated posting has been paused: %(reason)s"
msgstr "Teie konto automaatne postitamine on peatatud: %(reason)s"

#, machine, plain1
msgid "Your account's automated posting is running again."
msgstr "Teie konto automaatne postitamine töötab jälle."

#, machine, plain1, python-format
msgid "Your account's automated posting stopped reading %(url)s after %(fails)s failed tries: %(reason)s Start it again from Settings > Bots once it works."
msgstr "Teie konto automaatne postitamine lõpetas lugemise %(url)s pärast %(fails)s ebaõnnestumist: %(reason)s Käivita uuesti menüüst Seadistused > Robotid, kui see töötab."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "Your account's automated posting was approved. Your feeds' new posts appear on your profile, marked as automated, within a few minutes. Manage it in [Settings > Bots](/settings/bots)."
msgstr "Teie konto automaatne postitamine on heaks kiidetud. Teie kanalite uued postitused ilmuvad teie profiilile, mis on märgitud automaatseks, mõne minuti jooksul. Halda seda [Settings > Bots](/settings/bots)."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "Your age"
msgstr "Sinuvanune"

#, machine, plain1, python-format
msgid "Your age was confirmed on %(date)s."
msgstr "Teie vanus kinnitati %(date)s ."

#, machine, plain1
