"\n"
"```\n"
"%(note)s\n"
"```"
msgstr ""
"Teie kaebus [käesolev otsus](%(log)s võeti vastu ja otsus tühistati.\n"
"\n"
"\"\"\n"
"%(note)s\n"
"\"\""

