msgstr "Teie blokeeritud ja vaigistatud kontod failina, mida saate hoida või tuua teisele kontole."

#, machine, plain1, python-format
msgid "Your bot @%(name)s has been paused: %(reason)s"
msgstr "Sinu bot @%(name)s on peatatud: %(reason)s"

#, machine, plain1, python-format
msgid "Your bot @%(name)s is running again."
msgstr "Sinu bot @%(name)s töötab jälle."

#. %(fails)s is a number of failed tries in a row (at least 10); %(reason)s is
#. the last error, a sentence.
#, machine, plain1, python-format
msgid "Your bot @%(name)s stopped reading %(url)s after %(fails)s failed tries: %(reason)s Start it again from Settings > Bots once it works."
msgstr "Teie bot @%(name)s lõpetas lugemise %(url)s pärast %(fails)s nurjunud katseid: %(reason)s Käivita uuesti menüüst Seadistused > Robotid, kui see töötab."

#, machine, plain1, python-format
msgid "Your bot [@%(name)s](/@%(name)s) was approved. It starts posting within a few minutes. Manage it in [Settings > Bots](/settings/bots)."
msgstr "Teie bot [@%(name)s](/@%(name)s kiideti heaks. Postitus algab mõne minuti pärast. Halda seda [Settings > Bots](/settings/bots)."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "Your bots"
msgstr "Sinu robotid"

#, glossary, machine, plain2
msgid "Your channels"
msgstr "Sinu kanalid"

#, machine, plain1
msgid "Your chat apps"
msgstr "Su vestlusrakendused"

#, machine, plain1
msgid "Your chat devices"
msgstr "Sinu jututoad"

#, machine, plain1
msgid "Your chat devices can't be listed right now."
msgstr "Teie vestlusseadmeid ei saa praegu loetleda."

#, machine, plain2
msgid "Your chat encryption was started over. Messages from before can't be read on your devices unless a browser where you used chat brings them back. If this wasn't you, change your password in [Settings > Security](/settings/security)."
msgstr "Sinu vestluskrüptimine sai alguse. Varasemaid sõnumeid ei saa teie seadmetes lugeda, välja arvatud juhul, kui brauser, kus kasutasite vestlust, toob need tagasi. Kui see ei olnud sina, muutke oma parool [Seaded > Turvalisus](/settings/security)."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "Your chats and their keys have been removed from this browser."
msgstr "Teie vestlused ja nende võtmed on sellest brauserist eemaldatud."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "Your chats are end-to-end encrypted, and the site can't read them. The key that opens them is kept locked: once with your password, and once with the recovery code you saved when chat was set up. If you forget your password, that code is the only way to read your old messages after a reset."
msgstr "Teie vestlused on otsast otsani krüpteeritud ja sait ei saa neid lugeda. Võti, mis avab need hoitakse lukustatud: üks kord oma parooli ja üks kord taastamise kood salvestatud, kui chat oli seadistatud. Kui unustate oma parooli, on see kood ainus viis oma vanade sõnumite lugemiseks pärast lähtestamist."

#, machine, plain1, python-format
msgid "Your chats run on Matrix, an open standard, on %(site)s's own chat server. Besides Chat on this site, you can use them in a Matrix app such as Element (web, desktop and the classic phone apps), FluffyChat or Cinny. They stay end-to-end encrypted there too."
msgstr "Teie vestlused töötavad Matrixis, avatud standardis, %(site)s enda vestlusserveris. Lisaks vestlusele sellel saidil saate neid kasutada Matrixi rakenduses nagu Element (veeb, töölaud ja klassikalised telefonirakendused), FluffyChat või Cinny. Nad jäävad ka otsast otsani krüpteerituks."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "Your child accounts will be deleted with yours."
msgstr "Teie lapse kontod kustutatakse teie omadega."

#, glossary, machine, plain2
msgid "Your circles"
msgstr "Sinu ringid"

#, machine, plain1, python-format
msgid "Your circles - %(site)s"
msgstr "Sinu ringid - %(site)s"

#, machine, plain1
msgid "Your commenting history will show here."
msgstr "Teie kommenteerimise ajalugu näitab siin."

#, machine, plain2
msgid "Your credit on this post is anonymous: other members see it as \"Anonymous #N\". Admins and the post's author can still see it is yours. This can't be undone."
msgstr "Teie krediit sellel postitusel on anonüümne: teised liikmed näevad seda kui \"Anonymous #N\". Admins ja postituse autor näevad endiselt, et see on teie. Seda ei saa tagasi võtta."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "Your curations"
msgstr "Teie kureeritud kanalid"

#, machine, plain1
msgid "Your custom filters have been updated"
msgstr "Sinu kohandatud filtreid on uuendatud"

#, machine, plain1
msgid "Your custom filters have been updated."
msgstr "Teie kohandatud filtrid on uuendatud."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "Your database gnome took too long looking up your question. He's been.... dealt with."
msgstr "Teie andmebaasi gnome võttis liiga kaua teie küsimuse otsimist. Temaga on... tegeletud."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "Your display name has been removed."
msgstr "Teie kuvanimi on eemaldatud."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "Your display name has been updated."
msgstr "Teie kuvanimi on uuendatud."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "Your drafts and scheduled posts"
msgstr "Projektid ja kavandatud ametikohad"

#, machine, plain1
msgid "Your email"
msgstr "E-mail"

#, machine, plain1, python-format
msgid "Your email %(email)s has been verified. Thank you."
msgstr "Teie e-post %(email)s on kontrollitud. Tänan sind."

#, machine, plain1, python-format
msgid "Your feedback was marked fixed: \"%(excerpt)s\""
msgstr "Teie tagasiside oli märgitud: \"%(excerpt)s\""

#, machine, plain1, python-format
msgid "Your feedback was marked fixed: \"%(excerpt)s\". Our response: %(response)s"
msgstr "Teie tagasiside oli fikseeritud: \"%(excerpt)s\". Meie vastus: %(response)s"

#, machine, plain1
msgid "Your followers"
msgstr "Sinu järgijad"

#, machine, plain1
msgid "Your guilds"
msgstr "Gildid"

#, machine, plain1
msgid "Your inquiry has been saved."
msgstr "Teie järelepärimine on salvestatud."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "Your language"
msgstr "Sinu keel"

#. the English uses "sign-ins" for every number
#, machine, plain2, python-format
msgid "Your last %(num)s sign-ins. The place is only the country, worked out from the connection. Don't recognise one? Change your password: that signs out every other device."
msgid_plural "Your last %(num)s sign-ins. The place is only the country, worked out from the connection. Don't recognise one? Change your password: that signs out every other device."
msgstr[0] "Sinu viimased %(num)s sisselogimist. Koht on ainult riik, mis on ühendusest välja töötatud. Kas sa ei tunne seda ära? Muutke oma parooli: see katkestab iga teise seadme."
msgstr[1] "Sinu viimased %(num)s sisselogimist. Koht on ainult riik, mis on ühendusest välja töötatud. Kas sa ei tunne seda ära? Muutke oma parooli: see katkestab iga teise seadme."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "Your media storage is no longer connected."
msgstr "Teie meediasalvestus ei ole enam ühendatud."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "Your media storage needs connecting again."
msgstr "Teie meedia salvestamine vajab uuesti ühendamist."

#, machine, plain1, python-format
msgid "Your membership of [+%(guild)s](/+%(guild)s) ended: you didn't have the %(coins)s coins it renews for. You can join again from its page."
msgstr "Teie liikmesus [+%(guild)s](/+%(guild)s lõppes: teil ei olnud %(coins)s münte, mida see uuendab. Saate uuesti liituda selle lehelt."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "Your membership will renew again."
msgstr "Teie liikmelisus uueneb uuesti."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "Your membership won't renew. You keep access until the day you paid to."
msgstr "Sinu liikmelisus ei uuene. Sa hoiad ligipääsu kuni päevani, mille eest sa maksid."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "Your message includes a word this guild doesn't allow."
msgstr "Sinu sõnum sisaldab sõna, mida see gild ei luba."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "Your new backup codes are below. The old ones no longer work."
msgstr "Teie uued varukoodid on allpool. Vanad ei tööta enam."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "Your new custom RSS Feed Token has been generated."
msgstr "Sinu uus komme RSS Söödatoken on loodud."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "Your new key. Copy it now: it is not shown again."
msgstr "Sinu uus võti. Kopeeri nüüd: seda enam ei näidata."

#, machine, plain1, python-format
msgid "Your original username will always stay reserved for you: <code>%(name)s</code>"
msgstr "Teie esialgne kasutajanimi jääb alati teie jaoks reserveeritud: <code>%(name)s</code>"

#, machine, plain2
msgid "Your other devices have been signed out."
msgstr "Teie teised seadmed on välja lülitatud."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "Your own circles"
msgstr "Omad ringid"

#. %(who)s is the @handle of the account being added, filled in by the page
#, machine, plain1, python-format
msgid "Your own circles. %(who)s is not told."
msgstr "Teie omad ringid. %(who)s ei räägita."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "Your own mix"
msgstr "Oma segu"

#, python-format
msgid "Your own mix ranks the newest %(num)s matching post. 0 switches a part off, 10 makes it count the most."
msgid_plural "Your own mix ranks the newest %(num)s matching posts. 0 switches a part off, 10 makes it count the most."
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""

#, machine, plain1
msgid "Your own password"
msgstr "Oma parool"

#, machine, plain1
msgid "Your parent or guardian didn't agree to release your account."
msgstr "Teie vanem või eestkostja ei nõustunud teie kontot vabastama."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "Your parent or guardian has been asked to release your account. Nothing changes until they answer."
msgstr "Teie vanemal või hooldajal on palutud teie konto vabastada. Miski ei muutu enne, kui nad vastavad."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "Your parent or guardian has turned this off for your account."
msgstr "Teie vanem või hooldaja on selle teie konto jaoks välja lülitanud."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "Your parent or guardian made this account for you. They can see what you do on the site (your posts, comments, votes, bookmarks, follows, guilds, who you chat with, that your account was reported and your recent sign-ins; the site never shows them what your chats say) and they choose which features are on. You can see which in [Settings > Content](/settings/content). They chose your password: change it in [Settings > Security](/settings/security) so that only you know it, because anyone who knows it can sign in as you and read your chats."
msgstr "Teie vanem või hooldaja tegi selle konto teile. Nad näevad, mida teete saidil (teie postitused, kommentaarid, hääled, järjehoidjad, järgnevad, gildid, kellega vestlete, et teie kontost teatati ja teie hiljutised sisselogimised; sait ei näita neile kunagi, mida teie vestlused ütlevad) ja nad valivad, millised funktsioonid on sisse lülitatud. Näete, mida [Seaded > Sisu] (/settings/content). Nad valisid oma parooli: muuta seda [Seaded > Turvalisus](/settings/security) nii, et ainult sa tead seda, sest igaüks, kes teab seda saab sisse logida nagu sina ja lugeda oma vestlusi."

#, machine, plain2
msgid "Your parent or guardian set a new password for your account and you were signed out. Sign in with the new password, then change it in [Settings > Security](/settings/security) so that only you know it."
msgstr "Teie vanem või eestkostja seadis teie kontole uue parooli ja teid ei ühendatud. Logige sisse uue parooliga, seejärel muutke seda [Seaded > Turvalisus](/settings/security) nii, et ainult teie teate seda."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "Your parent or guardian stopped managing your account. It keeps the child lock until you confirm your age in Settings > Content. They chose your password: change it in [Settings > Security](/settings/security), or they can still sign in as you."
msgstr "Teie vanem või hooldaja lõpetas teie konto haldamise. See hoiab lapse lukus, kuni kinnitate oma vanuse seadistustes Sisu. Nad valisid teie parooli: muutke seda [Seaded > Turvalisus](/settings/security) või nad saavad endiselt sisse logida."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "Your parent or guardian's account was suspended, so yours is suspended until theirs is back."
msgstr "Teie vanema või eestkostja konto peatati, nii et teie oma peatatakse, kuni nende oma on tagasi."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "Your password"
msgstr "Parool"

#, machine, plain2
msgid "Your password has been changed. Your other devices have been signed out."
msgstr "Sinu parool on muudetud. Teie teised seadmed on välja lülitatud."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "Your password meets the requirements."
msgstr "Teie parool vastab nõuetele."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "Your payouts"
msgstr "Teie väljamaksed"

#, machine, plain1
msgid "Your phone approved this. Only continue if this is your account."
msgstr "Su telefon kiitis selle heaks. Jätkake ainult siis, kui see on teie konto."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "Your phone said no, so nobody was signed in."
msgstr "Teie telefon ütles ei, nii et keegi ei olnud sisse logitud."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "Your post is listed on your profile either way. Choose My profile to have its comments there too, and add guilds to post it straight into them: each guild gets its own copy with its own votes and comments."
msgstr "Teie postitus on loetletud teie profiilis. Vali Minu profiil on oma kommentaarid ka seal ja lisada gildid postitada see otse neile: iga gild saab oma koopia oma hääli ja kommentaare."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "Your posting history will show here."
msgstr "Teie postituse ajalugu näitab siin."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "Your posts are kept out of All."
msgstr "Sinu postitused on kõigist eemal."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "Your posts can appear in All."
msgstr "Sinu postitused võivad ilmuda kõigis."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "Your posts from the last 28 days, with what each got (a post and its guild forwards added up). Only you can see this; these are counts, never names."
msgstr "Teie postitused viimasest 28 päevast koos sellega, mida igaüks sai (postitus ja selle gild edasi). Ainult teie näete seda; need on loendused, mitte kunagi nimed."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "Your posts stay on your profile and in the feeds of people who follow you, but All leaves them out. Copies you forward to a guild follow that guild's own setting, and anonymous posts always appear in All, so nobody can tell which ones are yours."
msgstr "Teie postitused jäävad teie profiilile ja inimestele, kes teid jälgivad, kuid kõik jätab need välja. Koopiad, mis saadetakse gildile, järgivad gildi enda seadeid ja anonüümsed postitused ilmuvad alati kõigis, nii et keegi ei saa öelda, millised neist on teie."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "Your profile"
msgstr "Sinu profiil"

#, machine, plain1
msgid "Your profile details have been updated."
msgstr "Teie profiili andmed on uuendatud."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "Your purchase was successful. A receipt will be emailed to you from Paypal."
msgstr "Teie ost õnnestus. Kviitung saadetakse teile PayPali kaudu."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "Your roles"
msgstr "Sinu rollid"

#. a notification. %(title)s is the post's title; %(reason)s says why, as a
#. sentence starting in lowercase.
#, machine, plain1, python-format
msgid ""
"Your scheduled post \"%(title)s\" could not be published: %(reason)s\n"
"\n"
"It is saved in your drafts, so you can fix it and post it or schedule it again."
msgstr ""
"Sinu plaanitud postitust \"%(title)s\" ei õnnestunud avaldada: %(reason)s\n"
"\n"
"See salvestatakse teie mustanditesse, nii et saate selle parandada ja postitada või uuesti ajastada."

#. a notification about a post with no title. %(reason)s says why, as a
#. sentence starting in lowercase.
#, machine, plain1, python-format
msgid ""
"Your scheduled post \"Untitled\" could not be published: %(reason)s\n"
"\n"
"It is saved in your drafts, so you can fix it and post it or schedule it again."
msgstr ""
"Teie plaanitud postitust \"Untitled\" ei õnnestunud avaldada: %(reason)s\n"
"\n"
"See salvestatakse teie mustanditesse, nii et saate selle parandada ja postitada või uuesti ajastada."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "Your security key"
msgstr "Turvavõti"

#, machine, plain1
msgid "Your settings have been updated."
msgstr "Sinu seadeid on uuendatud."

#, machine, plain1, python-format
msgid "Your shared draft couldn't be published: %(error)s [Open the draft](%(link)s)"
msgstr "Teie ühist projekti ei saanud avaldada: %(error)s [Ava mustand](%(link)s"

#, machine, plain1
msgid "Your shared drafts"
msgstr "Teie ühised projektid"

#, machine, plain1, python-format
msgid "Your siege failed. One of the guildmasters created or edited a comment in +%(guild)s within the last 60 days. You may try again in 7 days."
msgstr "Teie ülevõtmisnõue ebaõnnestus. Üks gildi moderaatoritest lõi või redigeeris kommentaari +%(guild)s viimase 60 päeva jooksul. Proovi uuesti 7 päeva pärast."

